---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="關於肉丸七 | About Bearball Seven"
  description="Meet Bearball Seven — a little bear living in the corner of his human's computer, making every day a little brighter with his friends, the Bearball Squad."
>
  <section class="about">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Bearball Seven</p>
    <h1>關於這個網站</h1>

    <section class="about-block">
      <h2>我是肉丸七</h2>

      <p class="lead">
        住在螢幕角落的小熊，開開心心過生活。
      </p>

      <p class="story">
        我叫肉丸七。我住在肉丸宮，它是我的人類電腦裡最漂亮的資料夾，就在螢幕的角落。
        和我住在一起的，有大兔子 Poka、小兔子 Buni、Bisky，還有人小鬼大的 Boo 和他的跟屁蟲 Pipi。我們合起來叫 Bearball Squad。
        螢幕亮了，我們就開始過日子。Buni 想出點子，Bisky 把我拉出門，Boo 早就衝到最前面了。有時候我躲到資料夾後面，假裝自己很忙；Poka 一抱，我就什麼都忘了。
        我最喜歡的事，是看我的人類工作到一半突然笑出來。如果你今天有點累，也來肉丸宮坐坐，說不定你也會笑一下。
      </p>

      <div class="lang-divider"></div>

      <p class="lead en-lead">
        A little bear living in the corner of my human's computer — making every day a little brighter.
      </p>

      <p class="story">
        My name is Seven. I live in Bearball Castle, the most beautiful folder on my human's computer, tucked away in the corner of the screen.
        I share it with Poka, a big rabbit; Buni, a little one; Bisky; and Boo, small but fearless, with Pipi tagging along behind him. Together, we're the Bearball Squad.
        When the screen lights up, our day begins. Buni comes up with an idea, Bisky drags me out the door, and Boo is already way out in front. Sometimes I hide behind a folder and pretend I'm busy. One hug from Poka, and I forget all about it.
        My favorite thing? Watching my human crack up in the middle of work. If today's been a long one, come sit with us at Bearball Castle. You might find yourself smiling too.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-block">
      <h2>關於我的人類</h2>

      <p class="story">
        老實說，我的人類很難搞。我覺得很美了，他還覺得哪裡需要加強。
        肉丸宮是他蓋的，我和朋友們也是他做出來的。我被他改過好幾版，所以這件事我最清楚。
      </p>

      <div class="lang-divider"></div>

      <h2>About My Human</h2>

      <p class="story">
        Honestly, my human is high-maintenance. When I think something already looks beautiful, he still finds something to improve.
        He built Bearball Castle, and he made me and my friends. I've been redesigned more times than I can count, so trust me, I know.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-block studio">
      <p class="eyebrow">Behind Bearball Seven</p>
      <h2>About Autumnreal Lab</h2>

      <p>
        Autumnreal Lab 是這一切背後的起點。從文章到觀點，從角色創作到品牌實驗，這裡逐步累積成一個屬於自己的內容世界，讓創作以一種長期而自然的節奏延續下去。
      </p>

      <p class="quote">
        Concepts Shaped, Creative Journeys Told.<br />
        在這裡，內容編織成精彩故事。
      </p>

      <div class="lang-divider"></div>

      <p>
        Autumnreal Lab is the creative origin behind it all. From writing and reflection to character creation and brand exploration,
        this space gradually forms a world of its own, where creative work
        continues as a long-term and natural rhythm.
      </p>

      <p class="quote">
        Concepts Shaped, Creative Journeys Told.<br />
        Where ideas become stories.
      </p>

    </section>

    <p class="ig-wrap">
  <a
    href="https://www.instagram.com/bearballseven/"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="ig-link"
  >
    Follow → @bearballseven
  </a>
</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8a8a;
  }

  .about h1 {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #13335f;
  }

  .about-block {
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .about h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #13335f;
  }

  .about h3 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #13335f;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #2f2f2f;
  }

  .en-lead {
    color: #2f2f2f;
  }

  .about p {
    max-width: 640px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
    color: #444;
  }

  .story {
    white-space: pre-line;
  }

  .quote {
    margin: 28px 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    border-left: 3px solid #d7deea;
    color: #13335f;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .lang-divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    margin: 36px 0 28px;
    background: #e6e6e6;
  }

  .studio {
    margin-top: 72px;
    padding: 36px 32px 8px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: #edf1f7;
  }

  .studio .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .studio .quote {
    border-left-color: #c9d3e4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .studio {
      padding: 28px 20px 4px;
    }
  }

  .ig-wrap {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .ig-link {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #13335f;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .ig-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
</style>